  "verify": "Pins from Waveshare's demo code and schematic (https://files.waveshare.com/wiki/ESP32-S3-Touch-AMOLED-2.41/ESP32-S3-Touch-AMOLED-2.41-Demo.zip). Two hardware revisions with different pins; this is V1 (no Rev2.0 silkscreen and no V2 QC label). The V1 schematic's chip symbol is labelled ESP32-S3FH4R2, but the same sheet has an external W25Q128JVSI, the vendor's build sets octal PSRAM, and the product is sold as an ESP32-S3R8 with 16 MB of flash: recorded as that. Brightness is a command to the panel, not a backlight pin. Compiled; not run on a board here.",
